<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Benefits' }) %>
<h1>Benefits</h1>
<p class="notice">The company is not a straw on the driver's back, and the driver is not the company's ATM. Company, driver, and family embrace each other.</p>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="stat"><div class="label">Vacation</div><div class="value">14 days/year</div><div class="notice">14 days per year, 7 of them paid (7 paid days)</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="label">Birthday</div><div class="value">$700</div><div class="notice">$700 paid on your birthday if you did not use your vacation</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="label">Thanksgiving</div><div class="value">$1,000</div><div class="notice">All drivers, paid before Thanksgiving</div></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Vacation</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>14 vacation days per year, 7 of them paid.</li>
    <li>Please schedule your vacation with the admin in advance.</li>
    <li>If you do not use your vacation, you receive $700 on your birthday.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>New drivers (first 3 months)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>During your first 3 months, the birthday bonus, paid vacation days, and the Thanksgiving bonus are prorated by the days you have worked: full amount × (days worked ÷ 260).</li>
    <li>Days worked = days with a load, as recorded in this portal.</li>
    <li>After 3 months, all benefits pay in full.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>More</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Thanksgiving bonus $1,000 — all drivers, paid before Thanksgiving.</li>
    <li>Settlements are paid every Friday, with every item shown openly.</li>
    <li>A safety bonus for drivers who complete safety training is under review.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
